---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import { SITE, withBase, absUrl } from '../../site';

// Oktoberfest Madrid 2026 = EXTERNAL event (Thu 22 Oct – Sun 15 Nov 2026, Westfield Parquesur, Leganés). Owner order via DG 20 Oct 11:33.
// Dubliners is NOT organiser, sponsor or partner. No Event schema (would suggest we organise it): Article only.
// Sport rows: only confirmedOnScreens rows already in src/data/fixtures.ts (checked 20 Oct). No transport routes to Parquesur.
// Retire future-tense Oktoberfest references after 15 Nov (PENDIENTES.md).
const path = '/oktoberfest-madrid-2026/';
const articleLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Visiting Madrid during Oktoberfest season: an international pub by Sol, beer and live sport',
  inLanguage: 'en',
  datePublished: '2026-10-20T12:00:00+02:00',
  dateModified: '2026-10-20T12:00:00+02:00',
  image: [absUrl('/images/bar-interior.jpg')],
  mainEntityOfPage: absUrl(path),
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Dubliners Irish Pub', url: absUrl('/') },
  publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Dubliners Irish Pub', url: absUrl('/') },
};
---

<BaseLayout title={'Oktoberfest season in Madrid: pub by Sol, beer & live sport | Dubliners'} description={'In Madrid for Oktoberfest Madrid 2026 (22 Oct–15 Nov, Parquesur, Leganés)? Dubliners is an international Irish pub by Puerta del Sol: beer, live sport Thursday to Sunday, groups and Erasmus.'} path={path} lang="en" hreflang={{ en: path, es: '/es/oktoberfest-madrid-2026/', de: '/de/oktoberfest-madrid-2026/' }} ogImage="/images/bar-interior.jpg" extraJsonLd={articleLd}>
  <section class="hero hero-compact">
    <div class="container">
      <Breadcrumb current={'Oktoberfest season in Madrid'} schema />
      <h1>Visiting Madrid during Oktoberfest season</h1>
      <p class="lead">An international pub in the centre, by Puerta del Sol: beer, live sport and a mixed crowd from all over the world, Thursday to Sunday and every other day of the week.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href={SITE.gbpUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Directions</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact/')}>Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split">
      <div class="prose">
<h2>Oktoberfest Madrid 2026: the dates</h2>
<p>Oktoberfest Madrid 2026 runs from Thursday 22 October to Sunday 15 November, Thursdays to Sundays only, at Westfield Parquesur, in Leganés, south of the city. It is an external event: Dubliners does not organise it and has no connection with it. For tickets, opening times and getting there, check the organisers’ own channels.</p>
<p>If those weeks bring you to Madrid, or you are already living here, this page is about the rest of your time in the city centre: where to meet up, have a beer and catch the game.</p>
<h2>Dubliners: an international pub by Sol</h2>
<p>Dubliners is an Irish pub at Calle de Espoz y Mina 7, in the centre of Madrid, between Puerta del Sol and Plaza Mayor. Locals, visitors, Erasmus students and fans from many countries share the same room: beer at the bar, German draught beer included, the big projector and 8 screens for sport, and conversations in English, Spanish and plenty of other languages.</p>
<h2>Thursday to Sunday: live sport we have confirmed</h2>
<p>These are the four Thursday-to-Sunday stretches of the Oktoberfest weeks and some of the matches already confirmed on our screens (Madrid time). The full list, updated every week, is on <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What’s On</a>.</p>
<h3>Thu 22 – Sun 25 October</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Thu 22: Europa League and Conference League, including Getafe v Lugano (18:45), Celtic v Celta, Bournemouth v Milan and Beşiktaş v Crystal Palace (21:00).</li>
  <li>Sat 24: Arsenal v Everton (16:00), Chelsea v Tottenham (18:30), Leinster v Munster (19:00), Atlético de Madrid v Deportivo (21:00).</li>
  <li>Sun 25: NFL from 14:30, Liverpool v Brighton (15:00), and El Clásico, Barcelona v Real Madrid (21:00). Clocks go back one hour that night.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Thu 29 October – Sun 1 November</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Thu 29: Copa del Rey first round, including Sporting Hortaleza v Sevilla (21:00).</li>
  <li>Fri 30: Connacht v Leinster (20:45).</li>
  <li>Sat 31: Chelsea v Manchester United (13:30), Levante v Atlético de Madrid (14:00), Munster v Sharks (18:30), Barcelona v Alavés (21:00).</li>
  <li>Sun 1: Racing v Real Madrid (16:15), Liverpool v Arsenal (17:30), NFL from 19:00.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Thu 5 – Sun 8 November</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Thu 5: Sparta Praha v Bournemouth (18:45), Celta v Union Saint-Gilloise and Getafe v Brighton (21:00).</li>
  <li>Fri 6: Ireland v Argentina, rugby (21:10).</li>
  <li>Sat 7: Arsenal v Hull City (16:00), Spain v Uruguay, rugby (16:00), Valencia v Real Madrid (21:00).</li>
  <li>Sun 8: Crystal Palace v Liverpool (15:00), NFL from 15:30 with NFL RedZone from 19:00, Atlético de Madrid v Barcelona (21:00). See our <a href={withBase('/nfl-madrid/')}>NFL in Madrid</a> page.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Thu 12 – Sun 15 November</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Thu 12: Nations League, Czechia v Spain and England v Croatia (20:45).</li>
  <li>Fri 13: Scotland v North Macedonia (20:45).</li>
  <li>Sat 14: Austria v Republic of Ireland (20:45), Ireland v Fiji, rugby (21:10).</li>
  <li>Sun 15: Spain v England (20:45), on the last day of Oktoberfest Madrid.</li>
</ul>
      </div>
      <picture><img class="split-photo tall" src={withBase('/images/dubliners-projector-screens-sol-1200.webp')} srcset={`${withBase('/images/dubliners-projector-screens-sol-800.webp')} 800w, ${withBase('/images/dubliners-projector-screens-sol-1200.webp')} 1200w`} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 720px" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Big projector and screens in the main room at Dubliners, near Sol" /></picture>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section band">
    <div class="container prose">
<h2>Groups and Erasmus</h2>
<p>Coming as a group of friends, a team or an Erasmus crowd? Groups are welcome. If you have a question before you come, send it through our <a href={withBase('/contact/')}>contact page</a>. More for students on <a href={withBase('/international-students-pub-madrid/')}>Erasmus &amp; international students</a>.</p>
<h2>Watch the match with other fans in the centre</h2>
<p>Whatever team or country you follow, Dubliners is a place to watch the match with other fans in the middle of Madrid: easy to find, open from midday and with sport on most of the weekend.</p>
<h2>Opening hours and address</h2>
<p>Monday to Thursday and Sunday 12:00–02:00. Friday and Saturday 12:00–02:30.<br />{SITE.address}, {SITE.postal}, by Puerta del Sol. <a href={SITE.gbpUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open in Google Maps</a> · <a href={withBase('/visit/')}>Hours &amp; map</a></p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<dl class="faq">
  <dt><strong>When and where is Oktoberfest Madrid 2026?</strong></dt><dd>From Thursday 22 October to Sunday 15 November 2026, at Westfield Parquesur in Leganés. It is an external event, not organised by Dubliners.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Is Dubliners part of Oktoberfest Madrid?</strong></dt><dd>No. Dubliners is an independent Irish pub in the centre of Madrid, by Puerta del Sol.</dd>
  <dt><strong>Do you show sport from Thursday to Sunday?</strong></dt><dd>Yes. Confirmed matches are listed on What’s On, with Madrid kick-off times.</dd>
  <dt><strong>What are your opening hours?</strong></dt><dd>Monday to Thursday and Sunday 12:00–02:00; Friday and Saturday 12:00–02:30.</dd>
</dl>
<p>Auf Deutsch: <a href={withBase('/de/oktoberfest-madrid-2026/')} hreflang="de">Oktoberfest-Zeit in Madrid</a> · En español: <a href={withBase('/es/oktoberfest-madrid-2026/')} hreflang="es">Temporada de Oktoberfest en Madrid</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
